Tracked so the directory survives a clone, and so the typecheck has something to
resolve. Stage #4.5 drafts live here — one directory per component, deleted when
PR-2 lands.

They are type-checked and linted like everything else. The kit's own measurements
record why: a blatant type error in a draft once passed the type check, the linter
AND the story build, because the story tool transpiles without checking types and
the other two were scoped to source only. The draft is the artifact the human freeze
gate looks at, so it had no quality floor at the exact moment it mattered most.
